SUMMARY:Swim Stroke Clinic
DTSTAMP:20260823T033706Z
DTSTART:20260823T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:Freestyle/Front Crawl Swim Stroke Clinic \nLearn specific drill
	s and techniques to improve your front crawl/freestyle stroke. Whether you
	’re training for competition or swimming for fun\, this clinic will help y
	ou take your stroke to the next level! This 2-hour class is open to all yo
	uth and adults who can swim 50 yards of the front crawl/freestyle swim str
	oke. (Under 12 year-olds participate in the first hour only).\n\nhttps://w
	ww.erjcchouston.org/event/swim-stroke-clinic-3/\n\nFrom ERJCC Houston
URL:https://www.erjcchouston.org/event/swim-stroke-clinic-3/
