BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/HTX-Event-LaunchKIT-TCG-Con-XI.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /HTX-Event-LaunchKIT-TCG-Con-XI.png
UID:lXOqXbF_dW-mm78YZG1bB
SUMMARY:Houston TCG Con XI
DTSTAMP:20260823T033706Z
DTSTART:20260904T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston TCG Con XI – The Long Weekend Belongs to Your Binder\nL
	abor Day weekend is three days off. Spend at least part of it doing what y
	ou actually love. Houston TCG Con XI runs Friday night through Sunday afte
	rnoon – Pokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, MTG\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Riftbound\, and 
	more across a curated vendor floor where the person across the table is al
	ready looking for what you’ve got. \n  \n📅 Friday\, September 4 to Sunday\
	, September 6\, 2026 \n⏰ Friday 3PM – 10PM | Saturday 10AM – 5PM | Sunday 
	10AM – 5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX \n🎟️ FREE Entry
	 + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🃏 Every Major TCG on One Curat
	ed Houston Floor\nPokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, MTG\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Riftbo
	und\, Dragon Ball Super\, Digimon\, Flesh and Blood\, and more. Find singl
	es\, sealed product\, graded slabs\, Japanese imports\, vintage favorites\
	, and competitive staples all in one place. \n  \n🤝 Buy • Sell • Trade — A
	ll Weekend\nThis is a buy-sell-trade floor\, not a one-way shopping trip. 
	The vendors here are collectors first. \n  \n🔍 On-Site Grading Submissions
	 & Card Restorations — Cappy’s Cards!\nHave a card you’ve been thinking ab
	out grading? Or one that needs a little restoration? Cappy’s Cards will be
	 on-site helping collectors with grading submissions\, restoration service
	s\, and expert insight all weekend. \n  \n💼 Interested in Vending?\nIf you
	’ve got singles\, sealed product\, graded slabs\, TCG accessories\, or any
	thing else the Houston community is hunting this Labor Day weekend\, apply
	 here → https://tinyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \n  \n🏨 Staying the Weekend?\nTh
	ree days is worth the trip. Book your stay: Here \nThe last long weekend o
	f summer is yours. Houston TCG Con XI.\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/h
	ouston-tcg-con-xi/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-xi/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT50H
END:VEVENT
