DTSTAMP:20260823T033706Z
DTSTART:20260912T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:[camping]\nReady for a scenic backpacking route in Glacier Nati
	onal Park? This is a point-to-point traverse over Gunsight Pass… alpine vi
	ews\, waterfalls\, turquoise lakes\, and a true backcountry experience.\n\
