BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/08/Event-Launch-Kit-Houston-TCG-Con-XIII.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08
 /Event-Launch-Kit-Houston-TCG-Con-XIII.png
UID:204BnewaD3pSGWWMQWFeP
SUMMARY:Houston TCG Con XIII
DTSTAMP:20260823T033707Z
DTSTART:20261120T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston TCG Con XIII – Another Weekend\, Another Hunt\nThe hobb
	y doesn’t slow down for the holidays\; it just gets more interesting. Hous
	ton TCG Con XIII brings the community together for another big weekend of 
	cards\, collecting\, and trading. Bring your binder\, bring your trades\, 
	and bring that card you’ve been sitting on since summer. You never know wh
	o’s been looking for exactly what you’ve got. \n  \n📅 November 20 – 22\, 2
	026 \n⏰ Friday 3PM – 10PM | Saturday & Sunday 10AM – 5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonne
	t St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Even
	t Highlights 🔥\nEvery Major TCG on One Houston Floor\nPokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\
	, MTG\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Riftbound\, Dragon Ball Super\, Digimon\, Fl
	esh and Blood – the full lineup\, curated vendor by vendor. Singles\, seal
	ed ETBs\, booster boxes\, and collection boxes. Graded slabs from PSA\, SG
	C\, CGC\, and BGS. Japanese imports and OCG product. Vintage and WOTC-era 
	Pokémon. Competitive staples for current formats. Starter-friendly product
	 for collectors just getting into their first game. Whatever you’re huntin
	g\, it’s on a table this weekend. \n  \n📁 Bring the Binder – the Vendors A
	re Buying Too\nThis is a buy-sell-trade floor\, not a one-way shopping tri
	p. The vendors here are collectors first. They’re working buylists\, movin
	g bulk\, and trading out of attendee binders right alongside everyone else
	. Show up with the specs you’ve been sitting on. Come ready to deal. \n  \
	n🔍 On-Site Grading Submissions & Card Restorations — Cappy’s Cards!\nHave 
	a card you’ve been thinking about grading? Or one that needs a little rest
	oration? Cappy’s Cards will be on-site helping collectors with grading sub
	missions\, restoration services\, and expert insight all weekend. \n  \n🎴 
	New to the Hobby? Start Here.\nEvery game represented\, vendors who genuin
	ely enjoy explaining the hobby\, and zero pressure. Houston TCG Con has al
	ways been the room where serious collectors and first-timers coexist witho
	ut either feeling out of place. Bring the friend who’s been curious. Bring
	 the kid who just cracked their first pack. \n  \n🛒 Interested in Vending?
	\nGuest vendor tables are open. If you’ve got singles\, sealed product\, g
	raded slabs\, TCG accessories\, or anything else the community is hunting 
	this season\, apply here → https://tinyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \n  \nStaying
	 the Weekend?\nThree days is worth the trip. Book your stay: Here \n  \nTh
	e year may be winding down\, but the hobby isn’t. Houston TCG Con XIII is 
	bringing the community together for another big weekend of cards\, collect
	ing\, and trading\, with one floor and every major TCG!\n\nhttps://ccs-hou
	ston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-xiii/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-xiii/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT50H
END:VEVENT
